    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Prime Geospatial\"\nsubtitle: \"Data Collection, Processing, & Spatial Consulting\"\n---\n\nWelcome to Prime Geospatial. After 8 years of dormancy, we are back to solve your most complex spatiotemporal and environmental data challenges. We specialize in reproducible workflows, data cleaning, and custom spatial analytics.\n\n## Interactive Proof of Concept\n\nBelow is a live demonstration of our web-mapping deployment pipelines, rendered directly from spatial data attributes.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"leaflet html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-573fd59bee406247c870\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-573fd59bee406247c870\">{\"x\":{\"options\":{\"crs\":{\"crsClass\":\"L.CRS.EPSG3857\",\"code\":null,\"proj4def\":null,\"projectedBounds\":null,\"options\":{}}},\"calls\":[{\"method\":\"addProviderTiles\",\"args\":[\"CartoDB.Positron\",null,null,{\"errorTileUrl\":\"\",\"noWrap\":false,\"detectRetina\":false}]},{\"method\":\"addPopups\",\"args\":[41.8,-72.25,\"Prime Geospatial Operations Base\",null,null,{\"maxWidth\":300,\"minWidth\":50,\"autoPan\":true,\"keepInView\":false,\"closeButton\":true,\"className\":\"\"}]}],\"setView\":[[41.8,-72.25],12,[]],\"limits\":{\"lat\":[41.8,41.8],\"lng\":[-72.25,-72.25]}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n",
